# needs-native-review: reports on the review list, 27 Nov 2026
#: client/src/components/reviewInbox/sourceWords.ts
msgctxt "review inbox: a row, what deciding it does"
msgid "Answering it closes the report, and may hide what was reported."
msgstr "Responderlo cierra el reporte, y puede ocultar lo reportado."

