msgstr "Una fotografía reportada"

# needs-native-review: reported photographs on the review list, 27 Nov 2026
#: client/src/components/reviewInbox/sourceWords.ts
msgctxt "review inbox: a row, what deciding it does"
msgid "Answering it closes the report, and the person who made it hears back."
